# Plugins to compile into this build — one per line.
#
# Add a plugin by writing its repository here, or run:
#     beelzebub plugin install <github-link>
# which appends it to this file for you.
#
# Syntax (same as `plugin install`):
#     github.com/org/repo
#     github.com/org/repo@v1.2.0
#     git@github.com:org/repo.git
#
# Leave empty for a plain runtime with no plugins.
# Then build + start the whole stack with a single command:
#     make start     (local, needs Go)
#     make docker    (containerized, needs Docker)
